uscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75439598_922593905276585_6992188724167063598_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=IdJiCwRxEbUQ7kNvwHYBEKN&_nc_oc=AdoUyzl0tylaO40uqwbKlq4LHDOVDzLlPqOIzTXI38nnN3MCi2EcVIY6pKUPNK5VRC4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRN4pYC0fIZIcyo0fPK9G4OyycgW2e3pcBImVUbuFQKfw&oe=6AFDE1E3"}, "display_name": "Spiral of Words", "keywords": [], "long_description": "SPIRAL OF WORDS is the platform for creative writings in VR, based on the collaborative online writing performance, from three locations, realized 1998. Authors of the initial SPIRAL OF WORDS are Vana Goblot, London, UK; Predrag Sidjanin, The Hague, The Netherlands, and Vladislava Gordic, Novi Sad, Serbia. \nWords written by authors are respectively shown in red, blue and orange.\n\nSPIRAL OF WORDS is built in VR through a linear, continual appearance of words, sentences, paragraphs and stories, which form a discernible spinning spiral. \nUser is free to interact with given words, by picking them, moving them around and forming their own meta-narrative in the process. \nCertain words in the Spiral are green, and, when selected, they trigger brief audio and visual effects which symbolize them.\n\nSPIRAL OF WORDS is an unrepeatable experience, in which user's meta-narrative only lasts for the duration of the session.\n\nSoundFX from freesound.org, by klankbeeld, timbre, inspectorj, moulaythami", "short_description": "SPIRAL OF WORDS is the platform for creative writings in VR, based on the collaborative online writing performance, from three locations, realized 1998. Authors of the initial SPIRAL OF WORDS are Vana Goblot, London, UK; Predrag Sidjanin, The Hague, The Netherlands, and Vladislava Gordic, Novi Sad, Serbia. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://virtualunit.org/privacy-policy-spiral-of-words/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "VirtualUnit", "support_website_url": nu